abstract: >-
  End-to-end validation of the five OmniOmics pipelines (MAGMA, SIGMA,
  DOGMA, DEFINE, PRISM) on public, non-simulated datasets with a published
  expected result: mock-community compositions, a reference genome, and
  published differential-expression results. Per pipeline: the curated
  reference, the exact run configuration, the observed-vs-expected
  comparison, the scripts that produced it and raw tool outputs. v2.0.0
  holds the validation (November 2026); the alpha test (v1.0.0, September
  2026) is kept in each pipeline's alpha_test/ folder. Companion package of
  the OmniOmics paper.
